      "value": "\n\n\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p>You're able to shift your shape to repair wounds and injuries. You gain fast healing equal to half your level for 1 minute. While Rapid Regeneration is active, you revert to your base changeling form and can't use shift shape. This counts against the frequency of your shift shape.</p>\n\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-effects.EffUsedRapidReg1]{Effect: Used Rapid Regeneration}</p>"
